 r←Test_AskNumber_001(stopFlag batchFlag);myGuiParms;parms;n;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise the "AskForNumber" method with defaults parameters only.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 myGuiParms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Request.CreateParmsForNumber
 parms.addToCaption←'My request'
 parms.question←'How many copies?'

 n←myGuiParms parms(#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Request.CreateParmsForNumber ∆Ask)''
 ⎕DL 0.2
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 n.Input ∆KeyPress'33'
 ⎕NQ n.Input 9995
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 ⎕NQ n.Btn0'Select'
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →T.FailsIf 33≢n.∆result

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
